  ],
  "text": "A legal answer can sound perfect and still cite a law that does not exist. Watch Article 1471. The hallucination trap sends one UAE law question through two paths. Left is a visibly cached, ungrounded model run. Right retrieves and ranks official law, then can cite only retrieved articles. A building collapses eight years after delivery. Both answers stream, and there it is, red. This law ends at Article 1422. Article 1471 is fabricated.The grounded path cites Article 821. Green proves the exact law, year, and article exist. It does not automatically prove every conclusion. The card shows the official excerpt and exact source link. Across 50 check questions, 90% precision, 88.24% recall, and 0 of 84 real citations falsely marked fabricated. Fluent is not defensible. Every citation should survive the record."
}
